# Mechanic: A mana ability added when an effect resolves keeps an identity distinct from the recipient's printed ability.
# Forcing: The three Forests pay Topsoil Turner, leaving the enhanced Snow-Covered Forest as the only mana source.
# AI behavior: No opponent hand or battlefield choices.
# Failure modes: Catalog failure ends the game on land play; one shared identity routes both offers to the same ability.
# Card roles: Topsoil Turner grants {T}: Add {G}{G}; Llanowar Elves spends one green; Grizzly Bears needs both.
# Protocol path: Cast, enters trigger, perpetual grant, land play, two mana offers on one source, spell payment.
